      "value": "Option Nr.3 is not \"Ignore the problem and pretend SDK2 content doesn't exist\". Option Nr.3 is \"We officially deprecated SDK2 years ago, and now things start to break, tough luck\".\n\nAt some point you have to deprecate things, if you want to move forward.",
