      "value": "@{5f4a81f11070fd54aeeaf0a5|full_name}: deprecation doesn't have to break things. Content could be migrated, following my point 2.\n\nthere is old content that will never get updated to SDK3, and while i personally rarely use it (i swapped my avatars to SDK3 the moment it got released in open beta), I still have older avatars, some of which I have lost the files of, and there are many public ones, which will stay SDK2.\n\nSure, VRChat has all the rights to break old content if they wish, but I'd imagine that there is still a not insignificant chunk of the community using that older content.",
